OL,3,APrincess Diana's 'revenge dress' goes
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuction house Sotheby's expects the
OL,7,Fdress to sell for up to #220,000
OL,8,F($300,000) when it goes under the
OL,9,Fhammer on 9 December.
